# Research (docs/re-field-hud.md): un-clear Thieves' Woods (kills = 0) so the spawner refills it, then
# watch the HUD while enemies wander (needs the hud_d0 state from hud_dungeon.plan in the same out dir)
load hud_d0
poke u8 0x020B4912 0
wait 100
dump 0x020B4908 0x18 area
dump 0x020B7F28 0x1A0 buttons
save hud_restock
shot e00
wait 8
shot e01
wait 8
shot e02
wait 8
shot e03
wait 8
shot e04
press Down 40
shot e05
press Down 40
shot e06
press Down 40
shot e07
press Down 40
shot e08
press Left 40
shot e09
press Left 40
shot e10
press Left 40
shot e11
press Left 40
shot e12
dump 0x020B6FD4 0x800 objs
peek u32 0x020B6CB4 x
peek u32 0x020B6CB8 y
peek u16 0x020AFF84 dummy
